  <item>
    <title>E31. 塞维利亚符合我们对西班牙的所有幻想</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d0162fb977fb2c470edc37</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d0162fb977fb2c470edc37</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 20:03:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去西班牙旅行第一站，你会选哪个城市？去完南部之后，我们会推荐塞维利亚！</span></p><span></span><p><span>今年春节假期，我们和好朋友们一同坐上旅行车，前往西班牙南部进行了一场堪比“花儿与少年”的家庭旅行聚会。我们途径塞维利亚——龙达——马拉加——nerja，最后到达格拉纳达。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这里是这次旅行日记的上半期，我们会带着大家细致地回忆从塞维利亚到龙达的旅途，详细介绍了塞维利亚如何深深俘获了我们。希望能让大家身临其境，跟着耳朵到达那里吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>内容简摘</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> 关键词总结塞维利亚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="403">06:43</a> 旅途以一场迫降拉开序幕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 在老城区随意漫步的见闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 西班牙广场——极繁主义视觉盛宴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2100">35:00</a> 花少状况来袭：停热水和出不去门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2406">40:06</a> 在吉拉达塔鸟瞰城市，视觉听觉嗅觉和腿脚都要用上！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3086">51:26</a> 世界上最大的哥特式教堂到底藏了多少宝贝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3850">64:10</a> 在弗拉明戈里感受西班牙式的生命力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4431">73:51</a> 欧洲租车小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4824">80:24</a> 安达卢西亚自驾路线&amp;自然公园</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5165">86:05</a> 在悬崖之城龙达受冷风吹 偶遇塞尔达瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5680">94:40</a> 下期预告</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>老友相册</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgoy457XvVgebYEWsyJzV6nXvifM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——从吉拉达钟楼俯瞰的塞维利亚大教堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlGoOLZS1d35YTq9syOKnTH49uW5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——从橘子庭院看到的吉拉达塔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkVQ-UmBOH32v1ya6gyAQWiArywz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——哥伦布灵柩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgztq4cbyz3EEW0XG7qhFwC3qwcO.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><br><span>——华丽宽阔的教堂中庭</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lscDyGNflAOgKoU7aJh4Sw0U7DKY.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——巨大的神龛讲述着圣经故事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoCb4BqiV275TFQkLvASaO3VpSJp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——饱和度超高的花窗圣光</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp2hvWGBUUh374Nf0CDW8D-J3kaz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——修成方块的树</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpF6hQpt9M5e3WlJgg4OGICkK7YB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——极繁主义盛宴 西班牙广场</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBfO2DOWqy2AFaQdKwPvl1J0_6m.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlWwwuq5EivYr5--zO9we1IsMTEJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——广场与我们</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljdJKAop8WqMvW5_x4Df2s8F0c8t.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——贴满瓷片的卡座</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsUS0BV0Slz-myFCyf8labovc1zE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——西班牙广场偶遇的弗拉明戈街头演出</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhPF5Uy3WDrMJfTn2Z6opjvAot3Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——夕阳下西班牙广场巨大的主建筑结构</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVpoDplqjmGrGJBgM4anlyN0gGz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——塞维利亚北部自然公园 都在和后面的云中雪山合影</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrB7V7fmDGrBRIV8UjFUtGP3BlJ3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——像塞尔达旷野之息般壮阔的龙达悬崖&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FldBEihXvHozT0Oi5hIvrRDwG67Q.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>——夕阳恰好穿过龙达新桥的桥洞</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【 ABOUT US 】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>哈喽大家好，这里是零度可可电台！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>这是由摄影师凌霄和服装品牌主理人成可欣创立的一档「电话粥对谈式」音频节目，跨越巴黎和北京两个时区。在这里分享旅行见闻，生活奇遇，和天马行空的碎嘴。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我们希望这里对你来说像和朋友打长途电话那样亲切自然，也像热可可一样美味又零度无负担！</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>🧊 ☕️ 🧊</span></p>]]></description>
