    <title>E26. 从囤积癖到断舍离, 只需一次地狱级搬家</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6902c44f7f1b08483a55321f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6902c44f7f1b08483a55321f</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Oct 2025 01:57:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>搬一次家等于渡一次劫——这期我们借一场“地狱级搬家”把囤积的自我安慰逐一拆解：从“可能用得上”的消费幻觉，到纪念品情绪绑架、赠品与收纳盒的隐形陷阱；也聊囤积与 ADHD 如何互相加戏，以及把“舍不得”训练成“舍得”的方法。听完，也许你会先清空一个抽屉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>内容简摘</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 如何一步步走向囤积癖的深渊</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 囤积癖居然代代相传</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="510">08:30</a> 囤积物类别1：生活消耗品 绝对没必要囤</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1007">16:47</a> 商家送的赠品也是隐形垃圾来源</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1349">22:29</a> 囤积物类别2：纪念品和装饰品</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1734">28:54</a> 古董市场爱好者的自我反省</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2087">34:47</a> 厨房是囤积的重灾区</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">45:42</a> 沉重的收藏品：杂志和黑胶</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3464">57:44</a> 小时候的老物件如何处置</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3711">61:51</a> 最难处置的收纳类物品</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4253">70:53</a> 衣物的断舍离</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5218">86:58</a> 居然连家具都囤积</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5317">88:37</a> 囤积癖和ADHD是鸡生蛋与蛋生鸡</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>老友相册</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuyFSMU_qftBCJT8SJ6mCNo--aaY.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>——成主播家的极繁主义</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnnOfykGmZgbKoM2PbVCzyWKdFp.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>——日积月累的玩具展架</span></em></p><span><