    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聚焦「异乡人」：嘉宾 Momo 的北漂起点与我在巴黎的漂泊日常。探讨饮食适应与住房痛点、城市尺度与社交距离、语言的隔阂与错位，也聊回乡成“外来人”的疏离与自我调适。北漂×法漂，愁与乐并存。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>内容简摘</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="35">00:35</a> &nbsp;新嘉宾介绍 Momo</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> Momo北漂伊始契机</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 大学专业斯瓦西里语有什么用</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 成都人掉进北京的美食荒漠</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a> &nbsp;住房——北漂最大痛点</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> &nbsp;初到巴黎的饮食过渡</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2044">34:04</a> 北京的城市尺度令人窒息</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2528">42:08</a> 作为巴黎异乡人的心态</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2972">49:32</a> 二位主播和Momo的相识过程</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 再回四川成了家乡的外来人</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3912">65:12</a> 法国回到北京 生出一身矫情病</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>老友相册</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrYPkPmz8lToIClsH0jl-OUrIuDo.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>——本期嘉宾，可爱的Momo</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo41s8r2uVpbvFAaDtkvV1hVh-t9.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>——两位主播和Momo</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【 ABOUT US 】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>哈喽大家好，这里是零度可可电台！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>这是由摄影师凌霄和服装品牌主理人成可欣创立的一档「电话粥对谈式」音频节目，跨越巴黎和北京两个时区。在这里分享旅行见闻，生活奇遇，和天马行空的碎嘴。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我们希望这里对你来说像和朋友打长途电话那样亲切自然，也像热可可一样美味又零度无负担！</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>🧊 ☕️ 🧊</span></p>]]></description>
