  <item>
    <title>E24. 空腹慎入! 谁能不流口水听完这期川菜特辑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687ee5eea9dec925007e2394</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687ee5eea9dec925007e2394</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 01:15:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>火锅, 冒菜, 串串香, 钵钵鸡到底什么区别？川菜就是像炼金术一样把味型打碎细分又重组，变成一桌桌火辣的诱惑。两位生于北方美食荒漠的主播聊起川菜纷纷口水若悬河，通过川菜两位才彻底打开了味觉之门，感叹原来食物可以有如此丰富的味型。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目深夜慎入，因为耳朵被打开之后，你的胃也没法装睡了🌶️</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>内容简摘</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="106">01:46</a> 跳过闲聊 开始正片</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 冒菜 火锅 串串香 钵钵鸡到底什么区别？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">10:22</a> 北京美食荒漠的原因找到了</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 望平街眼花缭乱的美食</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="907">15:07</a> 自贡 乐山 四川其他城市更好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 用川火锅拉踩北京涮肉</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 没有一头猪能活着走出四川</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 偶遇地道冒菜馆子——李香辣</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2086">34:46</a> 成都可以消除所有坏脾气</span></p><span></span><p><span>·<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 对美食“水性杨花”的成都人</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><span>【 </span><strong><span>老友相册</span></strong><span> 】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgaObW-EFuZohSXyQQ8No9r3deYO.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—情妹杷泥鳅：鳝鱼 腰花 鸭掌 豆腐脑花</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQkA5ESziFwlaLapsz7b0Yju14b.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—钵钵鸡和夫妻肺片 一桌凉菜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvaiKkUoal2ibGZeYmb8LQeItLod.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—钵钵鸡和蹄花汤</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv28spQYyqkodB3soHsXTM9eSQbs.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—冷锅串串香 这已经是拿的第二锅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr5o4LUAmkQ6_akCYiStFn4x9QZh.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkYPDfHnAx5sM3iLAh867lje7a0B.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—自贡爆炒</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lt7o0kehompDE6jNQw9eFrKzsAej.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>—自贡菜剁辣椒的嬢嬢</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvaTndFWoytfnC_0NrJ0pVXPLbVq.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—肉类分不同时间烫涮的李香辣冒菜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkpJcYDSdVLdx_6rLoP6_1CWDKqf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>—吃光109块的一盆冒菜</span></p><span></span><p><span>✧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【 ABOUT US 】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>哈喽大家好，这里是零度可可电台！</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>这是由摄影师凌霄和服装品牌主理人成可欣创立的一档「电话粥对谈式」音频节目，跨越巴黎和北京两个时区。在这里分享旅行见闻，生活奇遇，和天马行空的碎嘴。</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>我们希望这里对你来说像和朋友打长途电话那样亲切自然，也像热可可一样美味又零度无负担！</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>🧊 ☕️ 🧊</span></p>]]></description>
